Preserve terminal output on OpenBSD while avoiding premature PTY EOF.
Open the slave before forking, then keep a supervisor in the builder's
process group to wait for the builder and drain output before closing the
slave. Preserve exit codes and terminating signals. Drain setup errors too.
Rebased onto Nix 2.35's separate builder header.

